<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIAN SECOND INNINGS SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIAN SECOND INNINGS SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
